Scripture

content/kjv-genesis-1-3.txt is Genesis 1 to 3 of the King James Version of the Bible (the Authorized Version). It is
the only source of Scripture the game quotes, and it is kept byte for byte as it was supplied. It is not covered by
the MIT License of this project: the project claims no rights in it.

The King James Version is in the public domain in the United States and in most of the world. In the United Kingdom,
rights in the Authorized Version are vested in the Crown and administered under letters patent by the Crown's
patentee, Cambridge University Press. This project is a free game that quotes three chapters.

This wording is a proposal and has not been reviewed (docs/design.md, section 11, question 3).

